  "purpose": "M1's scenario (planning/mvp-m1-plan.md, Scenarios and the harness, Q10): Instance 2 of security model v1 on M0's two Linux domains, each on its own hart, with one declared channel page that G0, the writer, maps read-write and G1, the reader, read-only, and three denied accesses that the monitor logs, delivers to the guest as access faults, and resumes. It names the binding, the rings, the run limits, the policy with its labeling and need sets, the manifest (domains, objects, channels), the accepted exits, the guests' roles and denials, and the expected outcomes of the scenario and its two negative images.",
